    "Product_Description_Legacy": "36 Inch Freestanding 4-Door Smart French Door Refrigerator with 28.7 cu. ft. Capacity\nPerfect for any home, this 4-Door French Door Refrigerator offers a spacious 28.7 cubic feet of storage space. With four glass shelves, gallon storage, an adjustable temperature drawer, and a freezer drawer, this unit can easily hold all of your food items. This Smart French Door Refrigerator includes a removable bin caddy, soft close drawers, an LED light wall, and Turbo Cool & Turbo Freeze to make your life simpler. Plus, it offers an internal water dispenser, an automatic ice maker, and more.",
